# Build artifacts of the plugin are committed so a GitHub clone is directly
# installable (`dsh plugin add <git-url>` runs no build). Rebuild after
# editing sources with `tsdown` (see README).
# Keep the local dev junction (`node_modules` → DSH profile fallback) out of
# version control.
node_modules/

pnpm-lock.yaml
# (package-lock.json is deliberately TRACKED since the CI consolidation:
# npm ci and the setup-node cache need it; the maintainer pnpm flow keeps
# its own lock ignored.)
# generated by scripts/make-smoke-built.mjs (see Run-Checks.ps1 smoke-built)
tests/smoke-built.ts